WEBVTT

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:00.611
and the confirmed public reporting.

00:04:00.653 --> 00:04:03.572
And we have put more
than four million of such dots

00:04:03.614 --> 00:04:04.824
on the digital map,

00:04:04.824 --> 00:04:06.492
all color coded.

00:04:06.534 --> 00:04:08.577
Still, how can a map make change?

00:04:09.829 --> 00:04:12.665
This is one of the largest
dyehouse suppliers.

00:04:13.916 --> 00:04:16.377
It used to have multiple
violation records,

00:04:16.419 --> 00:04:20.131
but insisted if they treat the waste
but not their neighbors’,

00:04:20.172 --> 00:04:22.967
they would lose their business.

00:04:22.967 --> 00:04:26.762
But then five brands, starting from Gap,

00:04:26.804 --> 00:04:31.058
all told this company
it would lose their business